  m_text: "=========================\n<b>- OWNER @ LA - </b>\n\nHi gangalang, I'm Monke Dev\n\nHere is what I do,\n\nI Create the game, mostly every asset is made by me\n\n- Most of the cosmetics and bundles are made by me, same with other stuff\n\n-I Basically do everything lol, most of the work is done by me\n\n============[EXTRA]=============\n\n- ! FUN FACT !    My old name was Sigma Cat studios but me and sigma cat studios are the same person"
